<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and heifers steady to mostly $0.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1125-1400 lbs 61.50-63.00, package blacks 63.25.  Select and Choice 2-3 1175-1500 lbs 59.00-61.50.  Few Select 2-3 1200-1450 lbs 56.50-59.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1000-1275 lbs 61.00-62.75, package blacks 63.25. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 58.00-61.00.</p>
</text>
